Modern primary button: less rainbow gradient, more refined. The current `linear-gradient(135deg,#FF6B6B,#FF9F43,#FFD93D)` with a heavy pink glow is a bit dated. Modern: a solid/soft gradient with a subtle inner highlight and a tasteful shadow.

